- "We came within a penalty shot of going into the Championship": the article mentions the play-off final but does not specify details about it, e.g., the penalty shot;
- "now we need to go a bit better": the article does not explicitly state the need for improvement, only that Slade expects the team to perform better than last season;
- "If we can add two or three more players": the article does not indicate an intent to add a specific number of players to the squad.

 - "years and years and years": the article doesn't specify exactly how long he thinks it could take;
- "Lord": the article refers to him by his full name, Gus O'Donnell;
- "UK to remain a member": the article doesn't discuss the possibility of the UK remaining a member of the EU. Instead, it discusses the possibility of changes within the EU that might reduce the likelihood of the UK remaining a member.
